const TILES=[['🏡','樱花小屋'],['📚','单词学堂'],['🌸','花园'],['🎁','宝箱'],['🦉','考官'],['🌿','复习森林'],['📖','书屋'],['🎨','衣帽间'],['🧩','拼写工坊'],['🌈','彩虹桥'],['🧚','精灵树'],['🏰','魔法学院'],['💎','宝石屋'],['⭐','星光广场'],['🎁','惊喜屋'],['🏆','城堡']];
const KEY='ayu_island_7_demo_separate';const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);const day=()=>{const d=new Date();return d.getFullYear()+'-'+String(d.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')+'-'+String(d.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')};const later=n=>{const d=new Date();d.setDate(d.getDate()+n);return d.getFullYear()+'-'+String(d.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')+'-'+String(d.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')};const shuffle=x=>[...x].sort(()=>Math.random()-.5);
let data;try{data=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY))}catch(e){};const existed=!!data;data=Object.assign({copyPreference:'tiles',stars:0,steps:0,pos:0,dice:0,learned:{},daily:5,seenToday:{},difficult:{},companion:'星团',costume:'🎀',unlocked:['🎀'],mood:75,energy:85,quizCount:0,log:'欢迎来到樱花岛！',lastVisit:day()},data||{});
let tab='home',question=null,answered=false,quizType='mix',hinted=false;
function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(data))}catch(e){}}
function fresh(){return Object.keys(data.learned).filter(id=>data.learned[id].date===day()).length}
function learned(){return Object.keys(data.learned).length}
function due(){return Object.keys(data.learned).filter(id=>data.learned[id].due<=day()).map(Number)}
// Voice settings are independent of learning saves: old vocabulary progress stays intact.
const VOICE_KEY='ayu_island_voice_v73';
let voiceConfig={accent:'en-US',voiceURI:'auto',rate:0.9};
try{const savedVoice=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(VOICE_KEY)||'null');if(savedVoice&&typeof savedVoice==='object'){if(['en-US','en-GB'].includes(savedVoice.accent))voiceConfig.accent=savedVoice.accent;if(typeof savedVoice.voiceURI==='string')voiceConfig.voiceURI=savedVoice.voiceURI;if(Number.isFinite(+savedVoice.rate))voiceConfig.rate=Math.min(1.15,Math.max(0.75,+savedVoice.rate));}}catch(e){}
let availableVoices=[];
function saveVoice(){try{localStorage.setItem(VOICE_KEY,JSON.stringify(voiceConfig))}catch(e){}}
function readVoices(){if(!('speechSynthesis' in window))return [];
 try{availableVoices=speechSynthesis.getVoices().filter(v=>/^en([_-]|$)/i.test(v.lang||''));}catch(e){availableVoices=[];}
 return availableVoices;
}
function pickVoice(){readVoices();if(!availableVoices.length)return null;
 if(voiceConfig.voiceURI!=='auto'){const exact=availableVoices.find(v=>v.voiceURI===voiceConfig.voiceURI);if(exact)return exact;}
 const accent=voiceConfig.accent.toLowerCase().replace('-','_');
 function score(v){const lang=(v.lang||'').toLowerCase().replace('-','_'),name=(v.name||'').toLowerCase();let n=0;
 if(lang===accent)n+=150;else if(lang.startsWith('en_'))n+=40;
 if(/natural|premium|neural|enhanced|high quality|samantha|ava|allison|jenny|aria|guy|daniel|serena|susan|google|microsoft/.test(name))n+=35;
 if(/compact|eSpeak|robot|pico/.test(name))n-=50;
 if(v.localService)n+=5;
 return n;}
 return availableVoices.slice().sort((a,b)=>score(b)-score(a))[0]||null;
}
function speak(w){if(!('speechSynthesis' in window)){alert('当前浏览器不支持英语语音，请试试 Chrome');return}
 try{speechSynthesis.cancel();const u=new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(String(w||'').trim());u.lang=voiceConfig.accent;u.rate=voiceConfig.rate;u.pitch=1;u.volume=1;const voice=pickVoice();if(voice){u.voice=voice;u.lang=voice.lang||voiceConfig.accent;}speechSynthesis.speak(u);}
 catch(e){alert('本机朗读未启动。可以试试 Chrome 或检查手机语音设置。')}
}
function refreshVoicePicker(){const accent=document.getElementById('voice-accent'),picker=document.getElementById('voice-picker'),rate=document.getElementById('voice-rate'),label=document.getElementById('voice-rate-value'),status=document.getElementById('voice-availability');
 if(!picker)return;accent.value=voiceConfig.accent;rate.value=voiceConfig.rate;label.textContent=Number(voiceConfig.rate).toFixed(2)+'×';
 const list=readVoices();picker.textContent='';const auto=document.createElement('option');auto.value='auto';auto.textContent='✨ 自动选择英语音色';picker.appendChild(auto);
 list.forEach(v=>{const opt=document.createElement('option');opt.value=v.voiceURI;opt.textContent=(v.name||'英语声音')+' · '+v.lang;picker.appendChild(opt)});
 picker.value=list.some(v=>v.voiceURI===voiceConfig.voiceURI)?voiceConfig.voiceURI:'auto';
 status.textContent=list.length?`已找到 ${list.length} 种英语音色。点击试听，选择你喜欢的声音。`:'未读到英语音色列表；浏览器可能只提供默认合成音，建议换 Chrome 或检查系统语音包。';
}
function openVoiceSettings(){const overlay=document.getElementById('voice-overlay');overlay.classList.add('open');refreshVoicePicker()}
function closeVoiceSettings(){document.getElementById('voice-overlay').classList.remove('open');saveVoice()}
function updateVoiceAccent(v){voiceConfig.accent=v;voiceConfig.voiceURI='auto';saveVoice();refreshVoicePicker()}
function updateVoiceChoice(v){voiceConfig.voiceURI=v;saveVoice()}
function updateVoiceRate(v){voiceConfig.rate=Math.max(0.75,Math.min(1.15,Number(v)||0.9));document.getElementById('voice-rate-value').textContent=voiceConfig.rate.toFixed(2)+'×';saveVoice()}
if('speechSynthesis' in window){try{speechSynthesis.addEventListener('voiceschanged',()=>{if(document.getElementById('voice-overlay').classList.contains('open'))refreshVoicePicker()})}catch(e){}}

function refresh(){ $('stats').textContent='⭐ '+data.stars+' · 👣 '+data.steps;['home','study','map','companion'].forEach(t=>$('nav-'+t).classList.toggle('active',tab===t));save()}
function navigate(t){if(flowTimer)clearTimeout(flowTimer);tab=t;question=null;answered=false;draw();scrollTo(0,0)}
function draw(){refresh();if(tab==='home')home();else if(tab==='study')study();else if(tab==='map')map();else companion()}
function home(){$('app').innerHTML=`<div class="card hero"><div class="character">🏰🌸🐱</div><h2>魔法冒险 · 7.3 自然发音</h2><p class="muted">认识 → 跟打或乱序拼写 → 穿插抽查 → 下一词，一路连贯学习；还可以和伙伴探索地图。</p></div><div class="card"><div class="row"><b>✨ 今日学习任务</b><span class="tag">${fresh()}/${data.daily} 新词</span></div><div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:${Math.min(100,100*fresh()/data.daily)}%"></div></div><p class="muted">已学 ${learned()}/688 · 今天到期 ${due().length} 词 · 已获 ${data.steps} 步</p><button class="btn primary wide" onclick="navigate('study')">📚 开启连续学习与智能复习</button><button class="btn wide" onclick="navigate('map')">🏝️ 小镇探索冒险</button><button class="btn wide" onclick="navigate('companion')">🐱 去魔法伙伴小屋</button></div><div class="card"><b>⚙️ 每日学习新词</b><p class="muted">试玩版可自主调整；已认识的词不会重复算新词。</p><div class="row"><input type="number" min="1" max="50" value="${data.daily}" id="count"><button class="btn green" onclick="setDaily()">保存数量</button></div></div><div class="muted" style="text-align:center">独立试玩存档，不覆盖6.0 · 当前离线HTML，不是已安装PWA</div>`}
function setDaily(){let v=Number($('count').value);if(!Number.isInteger(v)||v<1||v>50){alert('请输入1—50');return}data.daily=v;draw()}
function study(){const n=fresh(),d=due(),j=data.journey;let resume=j&&j.active&&j.date===day();$('app').innerHTML=`<div class="card"><div class="title">📚 樱花课堂 · 连贯学习</div><div class="journey-banner"><div style="font-size:42px;text-align:center">🌸 📖 🦉 ✍️</div><p style="text-align:center"><b>认识 → 逐字跟打／乱序拼写 → 穿插抽查 → 下一词</b></p><p class="muted" style="text-align:center">系统会在学习途中突然插入旧词抽查，答完直接接着学，不需要回菜单。</p></div><p>今日已认识：<b>${n}/${data.daily}</b> · 到期旧词：<b>${d.length}</b></p><div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:${Math.min(100,100*n/data.daily)}%"></div></div><button class="btn primary wide" onclick="startJourney()" ${!resume&&(n>=data.daily||learned()>=688)?'disabled':''}>${resume?'▶️ 接着刚才的进度学习':'🌸 开始今日连续学习'}</button><div class="soft"><b>🌿 独立复习 / 专项练习</b><div class="study-list">下面的按钮是额外练习，不用点它们才能触发课堂中的随机抽查。</div><button class="btn green wide" onclick="startQuiz('due')" ${!d.length?'disabled':''}>复习到期旧词（${d.length}）</button><button class="btn wide" onclick="startQuiz('random')" ${!learned()?'disabled':''}>🎲 自由随机默写 / 单词抽查</button><button class="btn wide" onclick="startQuiz('wrong')" ${!Object.keys(data.difficult).length?'disabled':''}>🚑 错词救援（${Object.keys(data.difficult).length}）</button></div><p class="muted">键盘跟打会即时标出字母对错，拼对自动进入下一步；答错的词隔开重练。本版本沿用7.0独立试玩存档。</p></div>`;refresh()}
function teach(){startJourney()}
function pickId(pool){if(pool==='due')return shuffle(due())[0];if(pool==='wrong'){const a=Object.keys(data.difficult).map(Number);return shuffle(a)[0]}if(pool==='random')return shuffle(Object.keys(data.learned).map(Number))[0];return 0}
function startQuiz(pool){const id=pickId(pool);if(id===undefined){study();return}newQuestion(id,pool)}
function newQuestion(id,pool){tab='study';answered=false;hinted=false;const w=WORDS[id];let other=shuffle(WORDS.map((_,i)=>i).filter(i=>i!==id)).slice(0,3);let opt=shuffle([id,...other]);question={id,pool,opt};renderQuestion()}
function renderQuestion(){const q=question,w=WORDS[q.id];$('app').innerHTML=`<div class="card"><div class="row"><b>🪄 魔法记忆测试</b><span class="tag">${q.pool==='learn'?'新词':q.pool==='due'?'到期复习':q.pool==='wrong'?'错词救援':'随机抽查'}</span></div><p class="muted">请选择英文单词的正确中文含义</p><div class="word">${w.en}</div><button class="btn wide" onclick="speak(WORDS[question.id].en)">🔊 听英语发音</button>${q.opt.map(i=>`<button class="btn option" onclick="answer(${i})" ${answered?'disabled':''}>${WORDS[i].cn.split('；')[0]}</button>`).join('')}<button class="btn wide" onclick="showHint()">💡 查看提示（音标）</button><div id="hint"></div><div id="result"></div><button class="btn wide" onclick="navigate('study')">返回学习菜单</button></div>`}
function showHint(){hinted=true;$('hint').innerHTML='<div class="soft">'+(WORDS[question.id].ipa||'本词音标未核对，可点击发音')+'</div>'}
function scoreReviewWord(id, correct) {
  const rec = data.learned[id] || {date:day(), stage:0, errors:0};
  rec.last = day();
  if (correct) {
    rec.stage = Math.min(5, (rec.stage || 0) + 1);
    rec.due = later([1, 2, 4, 7, 15, 30][rec.stage]);
    data.steps++;
    data.stars += hinted ? 1 : 3;
    data.quizCount++;
    if (data.quizCount % 3 === 0) data.dice++;
    delete data.difficult[id];
  } else {
    rec.errors = (rec.errors || 0) + 1;
    rec.stage = 0;
    rec.due = later(1);
    data.difficult[id] = (data.difficult[id] || 0) + 1;
  }
  data.learned[id] = rec;
  save();
}
function answer(i){if(answered)return;answered=true;const q=question,w=WORDS[q.id],correct=i===q.id;scoreReviewWord(q.id, correct);renderQuestion();$('result').innerHTML=`<div class="feedback ${correct?'':'bad'}"><b>${correct?'🎉 回答正确！+1步，+'+(hinted?1:3)+'星星':'🌱 答错啦，已加入错词循环'}</b><p>${w.en}：${w.cn}</p>${correct&&data.quizCount%3===0?'🎲 你还获得了1次掷骰机会！':''}</div><button class="btn primary wide" onclick="${correct?'startQuiz(\'random\')':'newQuestion('+q.id+',\'wrong\')'}">${correct?'继续随机抽查':'重新认识并练习'}</button>`;refresh()}
function land(){const c=TILES[data.pos];let extra='';if([3,12,14].includes(data.pos)){data.stars+=5;extra='🎁 找到5颗星星！'}else if([1,4,5,8].includes(data.pos)){extra='📚 这里有学习挑战，可以到学习课堂完成。'}else if([7,10].includes(data.pos)){extra='✨ 遇到魔法伙伴，可以去小屋互动。'}else extra='🌸 新风景已解锁！';data.log='抵达「'+c[1]+'」！'+extra;save()}
function rollDice(){if(data.dice<=0){alert('先完成3道正确练习，获得骰子机会吧！');return}data.dice--;const n=1+Math.floor(Math.random()*3);data.pos=(data.pos+n)%TILES.length;land();map()}
function freeMove(){if(data.steps<2){alert('需要2个学习步数才能自由前进1格');return}data.steps-=2;data.pos=(data.pos+1)%TILES.length;land();map()}
function map(){$('app').innerHTML=`<div class="card"><div class="row"><div class="title">🎲 樱花岛大富翁</div><span class="tag">🏰 第1章</span></div><div class="map">${TILES.map((c,i)=>`<div class="tile ${data.pos===i?'current':''}"><div class="num">${i+1}</div><div class="emoji">${data.pos===i?'🧙':c[0]}</div><div class="name">${c[1]}</div></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="soft">${data.log}</div><div class="row"><span class="pill">🎲 可用 ${data.dice} 次</span><span class="pill">👣 步数 ${data.steps}</span></div><button class="btn primary wide" onclick="rollDice()" ${!data.dice?'disabled':''}>🎲 掷骰子（随机前进1—3格）</button><button class="btn green wide" onclick="freeMove()" ${data.steps<2?'disabled':''}>👣 消耗2步，自由前进1格</button><button class="btn wide" onclick="navigate('study')">📚 做题获得步数与骰子</button><p class="muted">示例规则：答对一题+1步，每累计答对3题获一次骰子机会；奖励与学习记忆记录分开，答错不会倒退。</p></div>`;refresh()}
const lines={talk:['今天樱花岛的风好舒服呀！','你想听一个关于魔法学院的故事吗？','今天的单词里，有没有让你觉得特别有趣的？'],play:['星团追着星光球跑了一圈！✨','一起玩找星星小游戏吧！🌟','星团打了个滚，尾巴上沾了一片樱花。🌸'],study:['我们可以一起复习一个单词！','忘记单词也没关系，可以通过练习慢慢记住。','要不要去复习森林探索？'],rest:['星团在软软的靠枕上休息。','午后的樱花小屋安静又温暖。']};let companionLine='星团正在小屋里等着一起冒险。';
function interact(type){const a=lines[type];companionLine=a[Math.floor(Math.random()*a.length)];if(type==='play'){data.energy=Math.max(0,data.energy-4);data.mood=Math.min(100,data.mood+5)}if(type==='rest'){data.energy=100}if(type==='study'){data.stars+=1}companion()}
function buy(){if(data.unlocked.includes('🧢')){data.costume='🧢';companion();return}if(data.stars<15){alert('还需要15颗星星才能解锁这件帽子');return}data.stars-=15;data.unlocked.push('🧢');data.costume='🧢';companionLine='换上新帽子啦！';companion()}
function companion(){$('app').innerHTML=`<div class="card"><div class="row"><div class="title">🐱 星团的魔法小屋</div><span class="tag">随时互动</span></div><div class="hero"><div class="character">${data.costume}🐱</div><b>星团 · 魔法伙伴</b><p>${companionLine}</p></div><div class="soft"><div class="row"><span>🌸 心情</span><b>${data.mood}%</b></div><div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:${data.mood}%"></div></div><div class="row"><span>⚡ 活力</span><b>${data.energy}%</b></div><div class="bar"><div class="fill" style="width:${data.energy}%"></div></div></div><div class="grid"><button class="btn" onclick="interact('talk')">💬 聊聊天</button><button class="btn" onclick="interact('play')">🎾 一起玩</button><button class="btn" onclick="interact('study')">📚 一起学习</button><button class="btn" onclick="interact('rest')">🌙 休息</button></div><div class="soft"><b>🎀 小小衣帽间</b><p class="muted">游戏星星可以解锁装饰，不需要购买。</p><button class="btn wide" onclick="buy()">🧢 ${data.unlocked.includes('🧢')?'穿戴小帽子':'15星星解锁小帽子'}</button><button class="btn wide" onclick="data.costume='🎀';companion()">🎀 戴回樱花蝴蝶结</button></div><p class="muted">角色对话由预写剧情随机选取，离线可用；不是真实AI聊天，不会因为你没登录而扣分。</p></div>`;refresh()}

