{title:'A New Idea',level:'进阶 · 创意',text:'Nina has a creative idea for her class. She wants to connect students from different schools. Her plan requires careful preparation, but she believes it is valuable. She makes a short speech to explain the project and asks others to share their opinions.',qs:[['Who does Nina want to connect?',['Students from different schools','Shop owners','Only her family','Tourists'],0,'她想连接不同学校的学生。'],['What does the plan require?',['Preparation','No work','A new car','A long holiday'],0,'计划需要仔细准备。'],['Why does Nina give a speech?',['To explain the project','To cancel school','To sell a book','To leave the group'],0,'她演讲是为了介绍计划。']]}
